OL,3,AHealey provides some breathing space
OL,4,Abut things still set to get worse for
OL,5,Amost
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Healey talked of charting a new
OL,8,Fcourse for Britain, but this Budget was
OL,9,Fmore about course-correcting than
OL,10,Fcharging down a new path.
OL,12,FIt was abundantly clear that the
OL,13,Ffinancial fallout from that conflict in
OL,14,Fthe Middle East has hampered the
OL,15,Ffinances of households and businesses `
OL,16,Fand the government's ability to help.
OL,18,FWhile the government targeted those
OL,19,Fimpacted by higher energy and fuel
OL,20,Fbills, the "breathing space" it aimed
OL,21,Fto provide was limited; it is a pill
OL,22,Fthat doesn't fully alleviate the pain.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,115,105,200,300,0,100
