OL,3,AHealey provides some breathing space
OL,4,Abut things still set to get worse for
OL,5,Amost
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe most telling evidence was that
OL,8,Fofficial forecasters predict that while
OL,9,Fearnings will rise, that is not
OL,10,Fcompensating for higher prices and
OL,11,Ftaxes.
